    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d267-a1">

                <pb facs="0798" n="782" sameAs="frus:frus1951v01/pg782"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Draft Statement Prepared by the Special Assistant to the Secretary of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Arneson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1951-10-22">October 22, 1951</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>A second atomic explosion in the current Soviet test series has recently
                    occurred. Further tests may be expected as a normal adjunct to the Soviet atomic
                    weapons program.</p>
            </div>
